  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Critical Bridges Resilience Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will improve domestic transport connectivity in Fiji by replacing four critical bridges on the country&apos;s main island with newly constructed bridges resilient to climate change and disasters. The project will enhance the capacity of FRA in asset management and preparing gender-responsive policies and investments. The project will also prepare an upstream, transport sector-wide multi-hazard and gender vulnerability assessment and an investment road map, including the preparation of at least one transport-related investment with innovative solutions to build resilience among the poorest and most vulnerable segments of the population.</narrative>
  </description>
